  "rules": [
    "Engine proposal and effective command policy are separate records.",
    "accepted_unchanged records a real captain approval when approval is required.",
    "modified preserves the original proposal for later debrief/comparison.",
    "A later decision supersedes rather than erases prior command history.",
    "Warnings are advisory unless backed by a hard authority/safety constraint.",
    "Actual consequences are linked later; they are not retroactively used to pretend the captain knew the future."
